   CONSTRAINT PK_T_FACT_MARGIN_CONTRIBUTION_ORDER_LINE PRIMARY KEY (CUST_ORDER_SID, CUST_ORDER_POS_NR) NOT ENFORCED 
)  COMMENT = 'A fact table with granularity one row per Customer Order Line (CUST_ORDER_SID + CUST_ORDER_POS_NR). 
             This is a derived table, based on several other fact tables (t_fact_customer_order_line, t_fact_customer_return_line, t_fact_customer_goodwill line, t_fact_goods_movement ..) 
             The table contains all metrics relevant to the profit /loss margin at Customer Order Line level. 
             IMPORTANT - please notice that here we have measures related to shipping of an item, returning of an item, having a "goodwill". While this events can be associated with Customer Order Line, not all of them happen on the same date (cust_order_dt). Some metrics are relevant for the date of the Return, other are releveant for the date of the Goodwill. Read the description of each column carefully to understand which metric (profit/loss amount) is accounted at which date.
             Table is materialized (instead of view) for performance reasons - it is supposed to be used directly by AI team and as a source for aggregate tables that will be used by BI';
